            <div xml:id="d922">

                <pb facs="1104" n="994" sameAs="frus:frus1931v03/pg994"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.512/1147: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-07-03T16:00:00-04:00">July 3, 1931—4
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>220. Your 380, June 30, 5 p.m. The Department is making a study of the taxation
                    questions raised in your telegram under reference, but, <pb facs="1105" n="995"
                        xml:id="pg995"/> pending the issuance of further instructions, your proposed
                    reply to Foochow quoted in paragraph 1 of your telegram is approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
